  hintId: tutorial_exploration_mineral
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Exploration - Minerals
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<b>Mineral Exploration</b>


    Explore underground caves filled
    with valuable minerals. Minerals are used to upgrade your robot systems and repair
    important ship components.


    Each mineral has a different value and behavior.
    Some minerals are easier to collect, while others require special handling methods.


    <b>White
    Ore</b>

    A common mineral that is stable and easy to gather. Frequently used
    for basic upgrades and repairs.


    <b>Purple Essence</b>

    A rare energy-based
    material with unstable properties. It may require careful handling during collection.


    <b>Black
    Ore</b>

    A dense and dangerous mineral with high value. Special methods may
    be required to safely mine and transport it.'
  isImageBig: 0
